103.
Register of accidents and dangerous occurrences.
- The Manager of every factory shall maintain a Register of all accidents and dangerous occurrences which occur in the
factory in Form, No. 26 showing the-
(a)
Name of injured person (if any) ;
(b)
Date of accident of dangerous occurrence ;
(c)
Date of report in Form No. 18 to Inspector ;
(d)
Nature of accident or dangerous occurrence ;
(e)
Date of return of injured person to work ;
(f)
Number of days of absence from work of injured person.
